	(text "PROJECT-SPECIFIC CAPTURE BLOCKS\n- U2 is the Pimoroni inky EEPROM on I2C1 at 0x50.\n- J3/J4 are Qw/ST on the same I2C1 bus; address 0x50 is reserved.\n- SW1-SW4 are rear buttons using software pull-ups.\n- J2 is the physical 50-pin FPC block captured from DESPI-C73.\n- J5 is retained as a no-BOM/on-board host-net cross-check until schematic review."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "30f5e016-7530-5263-8f16-492f11c9c68a")
	)
	(text "Additional pin functions:\nhttps://pinout.xyz/"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 179.07 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "36e2c557-2c2a-4fba-9b6f-1167ab8ec281")
	)
	(text "DESPI-C73 PANEL-SIDE CAPTURE\n100-series references correspond to DESPI-C73 source refs.\nExample: C101 = DESPI C1, Q101 = DESPI Q1.\nFirst-pass capture: review polarity, FPC orientation, and footprints before layout."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3701c5b0-5815-55d0-a941-59c2878ccc4c")
	)
	(text "DESPI-C73 PANEL-SIDE CAPTURE\nJ2 and 100-series DESPI parts are first-pass capture from reference/despi-c73-schematic-20220728.pdf.\nReview diode/MOSFET polarity, FPC contact orientation, footprints, and orderable MPNs before layout."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 215.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4591b7c5-92e9-55c3-a5af-e18707103c90")
	)
	(text "ID_SD and ID_SC PINS:\nThese pins are reserved for HAT ID EEPROM.\n\nAt boot time this I2C interface will be\ninterrogated to look for an EEPROM\nthat identifes the attached board and\nallows automagic setup of the GPIOs\n(and optionally, Linux drivers).\n\nBridging JP1 enables HAT+ ID EEPROM write protection.\n\nDO NOT USE these pins for anything other\nthan attaching an I2C ID EEPROM. Leave\nunconnected if ID EEPROM not required."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 193.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8714082a-55fe-4a29-9d48-99ae1ef73073")
	)
